      "writtenOn": "2022-03-08T14:59:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "To sum up--not intended as a stepping stone, this was my planned end-state. If you think we can take it further, or have a better design in mind, I\u0027m definitely open to ideas.",
      "parentUuid": "f9869a0d_92cb7412",
      "range": {
